    {
      "block_id": "BL-6137-3.3.01-08",
      "block_type": "plain_explanation",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "Aerial photographs require similar care. Identify visible buildings or the stated dwelling symbols rather than count every roof as a separate household. Barns, workshops and homes can look similar. A caption or key can identify the intended objects. The lesson concerns arrangement; household numbers or occupancy require appropriate data rather than assumptions from building size.",
